# Ooze Patrol (2/2): "When this creature enters, mill two cards, then put a +1/+1 counter on this creature for each artifact and/or
# creature card in your graveyard." Black Lotus, sacrificed for the mana that casts it, is already in the graveyard (an artifact
# card). The mill puts Memnite (an artifact creature card: it is one card, so it counts once, not twice) and an Island there. That is
# two such cards, so two counters: a 4/4. Counted when the ability resolves, after the mill.

